# --- Build artifacts (all apps) — safety net, never commit these ---
# .claude/ … claude CLI がフォルダごとに作るローカル設定（許可リスト等）。PCごとのものなので配らない
**/.claude/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/dist/
**/.turbo/
**/__pycache__/
**/.DS_Store

# --- Secrets (all apps) — never commit; keep keys local per machine ---
**/.secret_key
**/.env.local
**/.env
!photo-remake/
!photo-remake/**

!owner-payout-tracker/
!owner-payout-tracker/**
owner-payout-tracker/.venv/
